## Context
PR #1048 (ticket 0589, merged 2026-06-13) rewrote §9 Future Research and added
four new entries to `report/refs.bib`. The PR body flags that these entries use
partial author lists (`and others`) for arXiv preprints — author lists and page
ranges were not verified against the source and must be corrected before final
typesetting.

## Relevant files
- `report/refs.bib` — the four entries to verify

## Actions
1. For each entry, resolve the canonical record (arXiv abstract page / DOI / publisher):
   - `Zhao-Bo2012:latent-truth`
   - `Balasubramanian-2026:correlated-judges`
   - `Sun-2025:skill-aggregation`
   - `ManriqueVallier-Daniel2016:lcmcr`
2. Replace each `and others` with the full author list.
3. Add/correct page ranges, year, venue, and DOI/eprint where missing.

## Verification
- [ ] No `and others` remains in any of the four entries
- [ ] Each entry has a verifiable DOI, arXiv eprint, or publisher URL
- [ ] Author lists match the source exactly
- [ ] Page ranges present for published (non-preprint) entries
- [ ] `make` builds the manuscript with no bibtex warnings on these keys

## Invariants
- Do not rewrite the citation keys (referenced from `main.tex` §9)
- Existing refs.bib entries untouched

## Exit criteria
- All four entries verified and corrected against authoritative sources, manuscript rebuilds clean.
